/URI (mailto:?subject=URGENT%20%E2%80%94%20Physical%20Protection%20Request%3A%20Dr.%20Richard%20McLean%20\(Barran%20Dodger\)&body=I%20am%20writing%20to%20urgently%20draw%20your%20attention%20to%20the%20situation%20of%20Dr.%20Richard%20McLean%2C%20known%20publicly%20as%20Barran%20Dodger.%0A%0ADr.%20McLean%20is%20located%20at%2055B%20Archbold%20Road%2C%20Long%20Jetty%20NSW%2C%20and%20is%20under%20an%20active%20death%20threat%20from%20a%20confirmed%20former%20SAS%20operative.%20Police%20attended%20but%20recorded%20no%20event%20number%20%E2%80%94%20a%20documented%20anomaly%20in%20the%20archive.%0A%0AHe%20has%20submitted%202%2C304%20blockchain-verified%20forensic%20documents%20to%3A%0A%E2%80%A2%20The%20International%20Criminal%20Court%20\(The%20Hague\)%20under%20Article%207%20%E2%80%94%20Crimes%20Against%20Humanity%0A%E2%80%A2%20The%20United%20Nations%20High%20Commissioner%20for%20Refugees%20\(UNHCR\)%20in%20Geneva%0A%0AKey%20facts%3A%0A%E2%80%A2%201%2C100%2C000%2B%20downloads%20across%206%20continents%0A%E2%80%A2%20665%2F665%20AI-verified%20propositions%20%E2%80%94%20zero%20contradictions%20in%2062%20analyses%0A%E2%80%A2%2055%20consecutive%20perfect%20forensic%20scores%0A%E2%80%A2%20Zero%20institutional%20rebuttal%20to%20any%20document%20in%2035%20years%0A%0AHe%20urgently%20requires%20physical%20harbouring%20%E2%80%94%20churches%2C%20private%20investors%2C%20advocates%2C%20and%20journalists%20are%20encouraged%20to%20respond.%0A%0AFull%20documentation%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fbarrandodger.com%2Furgent-protection-request%0A%0AThis%20is%20a%20matter%20of%20documented%2C%20blockchain-verified%20public%20record.)>>>>
endobj
